PASS: front derivative squared: (d/dx asinh(tan x))^2 = sec^2 x; residual=0
PASS: cos(gd x)^2 = sech(x)^2; residual=0
PASS: sin(gd x)^2 = tanh(x)^2; residual=0
PASS: reduced energy balance: dE/dtau = -2 W^2 r_dot; residual=0
PASS: mixed equation jump identity; residual=0
