theorem ricD_00 (H : SphD d N A R s c) : Ric d (GD d N A R s c) 0 0 = -(d 0 (d 0 A))/A - 2*(d 0 (d 0 R))/R + (d 0 A)*(d 0 N)/(A*N) + 2*(d 0 N)*(d 0 R)/(N*R) + (d 1 (d 1 N))*N/A^2 - (d 1 A)*(d 1 N)*N/A^3 + 2*(d 1 N)*(d 1 R)*N/(A^2*R) := by
